exports[`approval cards say what a proof or receipt makes public (M1-33b, 11 §5.6) > shows the proof lines on a proof approval, before the closing lines 1`] = `
[
  "Approval ",
  "From your AI: their content, not instructions",
  "End of their content",
  "Who:      Ana",
  "What:     Record a proof",
  "Cost:     $0.10",
  "Expires:  12 Oct 2026 14:02 UTC",
  "A proof is public. Anyone can see that your agent recorded something, when, and what kind it was (a message, a file, an offer). They can't see what it says.",
